# Email Card Enhancement: Icons and Justification

We will refine the "Correos Electrónicos" card in [ContactInfo.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/Documents/landing-siprac/landing-siprac/siprac-website/components/contact/ContactInfo.tsx) by adding a semantic icon and improving text alignment.

## Proposed Changes

### [Contact Component]
#### [MODIFY] [ContactInfo.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/Documents/landing-siprac/landing-siprac/siprac-website/components/contact/ContactInfo.tsx)
- Import `Send` from `lucide-react`.
- Update the "Correos Electrónicos" items to display the `Send` icon next to each email address.
- Change the alignment of phone and email items to `justify-start` (previously `justify-center`) to better accommodate long email addresses and the new icons. This will provide a cleaner, more professional "list" look.
- Ensure the icon size and spacing are consistent with the phone card.

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Run `npm run build` to verify imports and compilation.

### Manual Verification
- Visual inspection of the "Correos Electrónicos" card to confirm the `Send` icon and the new left-alignment.
- Verify that the layout remains balanced on both mobile and desktop.
